    a text called 'the literal text' is "{'the magnitude'}".
    a number called 'the expected truthy' is 1.
    If 'the sign draw' is 0 then,
        Set 'the literal text' to "0",
        Set 'the expected truthy' to 0.
    If 'the sign draw' is 2 then,
        Set 'the literal text' to "0 subtract {'the magnitude'}".
