    a text called 'the braced check' is 'gen assert number is' of "EXP-30" and 'the braced result name' and 'the braced expected'.
    a list called 'the lines' is ['the digits decl', 'the tight decl', 'the tight check', 'the first float decl', 'the second float decl', 'the braced decl', 'the braced check'].
    'gen join lines' of indent and nested and 'the lines'.

